# Line endings stay exactly as they are on disk.
* -text

# ...but "-text" also makes git diff treat a file as binary, which turned a
# whole commit of studio.js into "Bin 39025 -> 48710 bytes" and made it
# unreviewable. Source stays diffable.
*.js    diff
*.mjs   diff
*.css   diff
*.html  diff
*.json  diff
*.md    diff
*.py    diff
